#X text 15 73 pd-saf is a collection of Pure Data external objects that bring professional spatial audio processing capabilities to PureData \, powered by the Spatial Audio Framework (SAF). These objects provide high-performance implementations of various spatial audio algorithms including Ambisonics processing \, binaural rendering \, VBAP \, and more., f 76;
