#X text 26 312 This includes issues such as incorrect source coordinates or positioning \, wrong channel routing \, unexpected speaker assignments \, Ambisonics order or level errors \, incorrect decoding \, gain inconsistencies \, unstable movement or interpolation \, or any other behavior that does not match the expected spatialization., f 75;
